From c06bb3987173967a52a08627e3d044b0754254ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikita Maximilian Grimm <github@nikitagrimm.de>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:32:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(observation): add borrowed sight_all and
 sight_selected views

Simulator::sight_all and sight_selected fill a reusable Sightings buffer
through Observer::visit and return a Sighted that borrows the world and
the buffer. Each ObservationRef lists the snakes, food and prey that
observe lists, in the same order and at full precision, without copying
them. Observations and sightings share one batch routine, including the
parallel path; the transport frame builder fills a Sightings too.
