Subject: [PATCH 2/2] perf(examples): compare owned and borrowed bot reads

Add official-128 scenario rows and -nearest-observe/-nearest-sight rows
for dome-proxy-96 and official-128. After an untimed step they time a bot
read of every living slot's nearest visible food and opponent head through
observe_all_into or sight_all. Bases without sight_all fall back to owned
observations so PR comparisons still build.
